00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067 line:92%
-Our first guest tonight i

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:03.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
CNN's chief White House
correspondent,

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
anchors "The Lead"
