00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:06.506 line:92%
and a best-selling author.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.876
His latest novel, "The Devil May
Dance," was published this month

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
and is already
a "New York Times" best seller

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:15.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
Please welcome back to the sho
our friend Jake Tapper.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:16.549 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
How are you, Jake?

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:19.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
